Package: AutoLD
Type: Package
Title: Dosage-Dependent Linkage Disequilibrium in Autopolyploid Genomes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Weihao", "Dou", role = "aut"),
    person("Libo", "Jiang", email = "libojiang@sdut.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements a population-genetic framework for reconstructing two-locus
    gametic dosage distributions in autopolyploids, decomposing them into orthogonal
    dosage-dependent linkage disequilibrium components, estimating effective marginal
    segregation distortion, performing fixed-margin normalization, simulation, and
    marginal-preserving permutation calibration. The current package skeleton is built
    around the core simulation and empirical genome-scan workflows.
